READING: coverGap = max over good set G_W of ||vmax*t||.  coverGap>=1/13=0.0769 => a point of G_W escapes the
far element's danger => M(V)>=1/13 (far element CANNOT cover). Only the AP-type (smax=0) has coverGap<1/13:
its good set sits ON the 1/13-lattice where the far element vanishes (the deep well). Non-AP => smax>0 => coverGap>=1/13.
